      "text_preview": "On due consideration of the rival submissions so also the facts and circumstances of the case,\nthis Court is of the view that both the Courts below have not committed any error in appreciation of evidence available on record and hence no in"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c35cb669333a427b91cd316dbc1eb310_38",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
